    "body": "Rebuilt on #348's new tip (5f17ea0, with the `.camtools` suffix fix), then merged upstream/main, with no conflicts. Quick gate: post, sim and app are green. The remaining reds also fail on main: `swarf_pose_continuity` (#351) and the GPU headless tests. One `shell` run aborted with SIGABRT at startup; four standalone reruns show only the known headless failure. That abort is the flecs first-world race from #379, fixed by #400. The branch merges cleanly with main. Merge it after #348. Flagging ready again.",
