    "updated_at": "2026-11-09T08:51:21Z",
    "body": "Brought this branch up to date after upstream #442 (Stock page theme button) conflicted with its parent #348 in the golden `egui_tool_editor.png`.\n\n- Merged the parent's new tip (`origin/issue/300-tool-library-io`). It carries the re-rendered golden, which shows #348's Export/Import library buttons and #442's Theme… ribbon entry. This branch doesn't change the tool editor view, so that merge was clean, and the follow-up merge of upstream/main had nothing left to do. Merge commit: `35acbd96`.\n- `tool_editor_snapshot` passes against the inherited golden without `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS`, so no re-render was needed here.\n\nGate (`scripts/gate.sh quick upstream/main`, app + ui suites): all 6 pinning tests pass (`handshake_and_tool_list`, the four `tool_library_*` MCP tests, `script_tool_library_verbs_roundtrip`), and `tool_editor_snapshot` passes too. The only reds are the known ones that also fail on main: the GPU headless tests (`headless_run_succeeds`, `headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`, `egui_headless_cli_exit_code_is_zero`) and `setup_stock_source::a_new_block_after_a_flip…` (#415, fixed by #420).\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. Flagging ready again.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
