    "body": "Re-gated after merging #444. `crates/app/tests/mcp.rs` keeps both this PR's tool-library tests and #444's stdio-hardening tests, and `mcp` passes 12/12. Geometry, cl, tools, post, sim, motion and clippy are green. The remaining reds also fail on upstream main d251029:\n- `setup_stock_source` (#415, fixed by #420);\n- the GPU headless tests;\n- the three shell / tool-editor snapshot goldens. These fail on main since v0.15.0, with a diff of 23, probably the toolbar version label.\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. Merge it after #348. Flagging ready again.",
